   "severity": "MAJOR",
   "key": "mobile.sidebar.row_status.approval",
   "current": "待批准",
   "proposed": "待审批",
   "reason": "Glossary/style guide fix the noun 'approval(s)' as 审批; the shipped corpus uses 审批 for the approval STATE (relay.asks.pending.kind_approval 需要审批, tui legend `lo !`等待审批, wire …审批已不再待处理) and 批准 only for the approve VERB/button (relay.asks.pending.approve, tray.approve). The chip names the pending state, the noun sense; the cited anchor owner_only uses 批准 as a verb in an action list. 待审批 is the standard pending-approval status word in zh-CN apps; 3 chars/6 cells, same width."
  },
  {
